invalid type: string "transport\nLEVELS OF PROTEIN STRUCTURE\n4. Quaternary structure\n79 80\n81 82\n83 84\n15\nSICKLE CELL ANEMIA\n• Caused by a defect in the oxygen carrier molecule. hemoglobin\n• Recessive allele disease\n• Oxygen does not get delivered to tissues properly\n• The defective molecules stick together & alter the shape of the red \nblood cells that carry them\ntention/self/